_ property-subscribers-lane = 0
_ live-actions-lane = 1
_ live-batch-run-limit Size = 1000000
_ @task tracker-action-previous [Tracker]?
_ @task tracker-action-next [Tracker]?
_ @task live-scopes [LiveScope]?
_ @task change-comparison-depth U32 = 0
_ @task live-batch LiveBatch?

` Slot zero is a sentinel: handle is the generation, slot is dispatch depth, prev/next are the
` active tail/head, and free starts the free list. Active slots store their generation in free;
` tombstones preserve prev/next for in-flight walkers and use free as their free-list link.
+ PropertySubscriber is (name String, handle U64, slot Index, prev Index, next Index, free Index)

+ PropertyTrackerSubscription is (action U64, handle U64, slot Index)

